<Normal title="Work with me">
	<div class="Doc">
		<p>
		My name is Oskar, I've been playing software on the internet since the '90s.
		I like building things that work, and I enjoy staying around afterwards as a sortof IT Hausmeister to
		<em>keep them working</em>. I do both, the new stuff and the boring maintenance and documentation that keeps old stuff alive.
		</p>
		<p>
			Twenty+ years of web technology, +5 years as CTO. I've helped start a bunch of things
			over the years, Alive Festival, Dansk Dynamit, Unicorn Workspaces, Strrr.tv,
			Radio4000. Since 2022 I've basically been deep in the AI rabbit hole, running agent
			and harness experiments full time, so I have a pretty good sense of what these tools
			can and can't do, and where they just get in the way.
		</p>
		<p>
		So what can I do for you... Build things, web apps, tools, automations &amp; pipelines, from artsy experiments to stable infra glue between various old APIs. I can help discuss product design and the technology specs for it. Or look after what you already have. And sometimes you just want a second pair of eyes to tell you honestly what's going on.
		</p>
		<p>
			I want to understand how a business really works before I touch anything, and I've worked with enough good people to know when to ask for support. Also worth mentioning: in my spare time I've mentored several friends to full-time dev jobs and I love this part.
		</p>
		<p>
			See <a href="/projects">things I've built and been part of</a>, read
			<a href="/blog">what I write about</a> (not a lot publicly), or
			<a href="/helpmehelpyou">help me help you</a>.
		</p>
		<p>
		<a href="mailto:oskar@rough.dk">oskar@rough.dk</a>, always happy to say hi!
		</p>
	</div>
</Normal>
